..h1 **Beans** by Colin

..author Colin
..time 90 minutes
..yield 30(?) servings

::recipe

    ..* `3` yellow onions, diced small
    ..* `3` bell peppers, diced small
    ..* `10` ribs celery, diced small
    ..* `1/2 c` olive oil
    ..* `2 Tbsp` minced garlic
    ..* `2 tsp` fennel seed, crushed
    ..* `1 Tbsp` dried sage, crushed
    ..* `1/4 c` tomato paste
    ..* `1 Tbsp` gluten-free Vegemite
    ..* `2 Tbsp` gluten-free soy sauce
    ..* `2 Tbsp` brown sugar
    ..* `8 cans` assorted beans, not drained
    ..* `3` bay leaves
    ..* `2 tsp` smoked paprika
    ..* `1 tsp` garlic powder
    ..* `1 tsp` onion powder
    ..* other herbs (thyme, rosemary, etc.)
    ..* `2 Tbsp` vinegar
    ..* `1/4 tsp` liquid smoke
    ..* salt to taste
